# A long list scrolled by the agent: down, on to its end (reachend grows
# it), back up past its start (reachstart adds rows above, anchored); an
# authored jump; a transcript that follows its end as lines come, until the
# reader scrolls it up. Each wheel moves more than a port, which the
# browser half reads as a jump, not travel: travel's lead is the wall
# clock's, so two runs would build different rows ahead of the port.
wheel long 1000
wheel long 2500
wheel long 5000
wheel long 9000
wheel long -40000
tap jump
tap say
tap say
wheel transcript -300
tap say
